{
  "message": "Thanks — I can’t find the card’s last 4 digits in the records I pulled. The dispute filing tool requires the card_last_4_digits field, so I can’t submit the dispute without it. You have two quick options:

1) Provide the card’s last 4 digits (from the physical card, a recent statement, or the Rho-Bank mobile app/online banking). If you give me those 4 digits I’ll file the dispute immediately under your Silver Rewards Card (cc_890389b165_silver) with the details we discussed.

2) If you prefer, I can tell you exactly where to find the last 4 in the Rho-Bank app or online: open the Rho-Bank app → Cards → Silver Rewards Card → the card details screen shows the masked number (last 4 digits). Or check the transaction details for the Marriott charge in Activity — the transaction view usually displays the card’s last 4.

If you’d like me to wait, send the last 4 when you have it and I’ll file the dispute. If you want help locating it in the app and want me to walk you through the steps, say which platform you’re on (iOS, Android, or web) and I’ll guide you. If you’d rather speak to a human now, I can transfer you — tell me and I’ll proceed."
}

